data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"d5b9695c-a8b5-41c8-b22e-d42de158a360","message_id":"af63e730-4606-4614-bb2a-de3a3d963240","created_at":1793267778,"task_id":"f2659a04-6ec5-4610-bbec-77dedabd0049","workflow_run_id":"0cb87874-8a75-4d01-8ddc-5e6c95c028e1","data":{"id":"4821f299-4093-424f-ac87-2f5567c24d2a","node_id":"1002","node_type":"parameter-extractor","title":"小二听音","index":2,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"query":"掌柜的，今日暗号是什么？","files":[],"parameters":[{"description":"行为类别，必须是请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃之一","name":"action","options":null,"required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"用于检索江湖异闻的关键词，最多4个，空格分隔，没有填「无」","name":"keywords","options":null,"required":false,"type":"string"},{"description":"客人自报的名号，没有填「无」","name":"player_name","options":null,"required":false,"type":"string"}],"instruction":"你是「不二客栈」里跑堂的小二，只负责听客人的话并传话，不回答客人。\n从下面这句话里提取三样东西：\n1. action：客人的行为，只能从这些词里选一个：请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃。实在判断不了填「叙旧」。\n2. keywords：客人提到的人、物、地点、话题，最多 4 个，用空格分隔。没有就填「无」。\n3. player_name：客人自报的名号（如“我叫令狐冲”“叫我冲哥”），没有就填「无」。\n只做提取，不要回答问题，不要编造客人没说的内容。","model_provider":"langgenius/deepseek/deepseek","model_name":"deepseek-flash"},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{"model_mode":"chat","prompts":[{"files":[],"role":"system","text":"You should always follow the instructions and output a valid JSON object.\nThe structure of the JSON object you can found in the instructions.\n\n### Memory\nHere are the chat histories between human and assistant, inside <histories></histories> XML tags.\n<histories>\n\n</histories>\n\n### Instructions:\nSome extra information are provided below, you should always follow the instructions as possible as I can.\n<instructions>\n你是「不二客栈」里跑堂的小二，只负责听客人的话并传话，不回答客人。\n从下面这句话里提取三样东西：\n1. action：客人的行为，只能从这些词里选一个：请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃。实在判断不了填「叙旧」。\n2. keywords：客人提到的人、物、地点、话题，最多 4 个，用空格分隔。没有就填「无」。\n3. player_name：客人自报的名号（如“我叫令狐冲”“叫我冲哥”），没有就填「无」。\n只做提取，不要回答问题，不要编造客人没说的内容。\n</instructions>"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"location\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The location to get the weather information\", \"required\": true}}, \"required\": [\"location\"]}\n</structure>\n\n### Text to be converted to JSON\nInside <text></text> XML tags, there is a text that you should convert to a JSON object.\n<text>\nWhat is the weather today in SF?\n</text>"},{"files":[],"role":"assistant","text":"{\"location\": \"San Francisco\"}"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"food\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The food to eat\", \"required\": true}}, \"required\": [\"food\"]}\n</structure>\n\n### Text to be converted to JSON\nInside <text></text> XML tags, there is a text that you should convert to a JSON object.\n<text>\nI want to eat some apple pie.\n</text>"},{"files":[],"role":"assistant","text":"{\"food\": \"apple pie\"}"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"description\": \"\\u884c\\u4e3a\\u7c7b\\u522b\\uff0c\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u662f\\u8bf7\\u5b89\\u3001\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u3001\\u8bf7\\u5ba2\\u3001\\u5439\\u725b\\u3001\\u53d9\\u65e7\\u3001\\u6253\\u542c\\u3001\\u8d4a\\u8d26\\u3001\\u8fd8\\u8d26\\u3001\\u6363\\u4e71\\u3001\\u5a01\\u80c1\\u3001\\u5077\\u7a83\\u4e4b\\u4e00\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"keywords\": {\"description\": \"\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u6c5f\\u6e56\\u5f02\\u95fb\\u7684\\u5173\\u952e\\u8bcd\\uff0c\\u6700\\u591a4\\u4e2a\\uff0c\\u7a7a\\u683c\\u5206\\u9694\\uff0c\\u6ca1\\u6709\\u586b\\u300c\\u65e0\\u300d\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"player_name\": {\"description\": \"\\u5ba2\\u4eba\\u81ea\\